[h1]❤️ About the Project[/h1]

Knox Survivors is something I work on because I love Project Zomboid and always wanted a living survivor system of my own.

I do not view the other NPC projects as competition. Different modders are trying different approaches, and I think that is good for the Zomboid community.

If you want to support development:

[url=https://ko-fi.com/drganja]Support Knox Survivors on Ko-fi[/url]

Knox Survivors is developed and owned by .exe.

Superb Survivors is an inspiration for the general survivor-mod concept, not a source-code dependency.

Project Zomboid and its original assets belong to The Indie Stone.
